{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;60fps mode comming!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm sincerely apologize for the inconvenience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Children disappeared, adults turned into carrion...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A certain isolated island that turned into hell</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect &quot;relics&quot; sleeping on the island and acquire skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on mysteries and powerful enemies using a variety of actions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark fantasy 2D action game by Magus, the girl in black.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark and rich 2D action all drawn with pixelart!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the action of the player charactor \u201dMagus\u201d with classic and easy-to-understand controls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revive the attacking opponent and use it as a trigger for jumping through walls, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't just defeat the enemy, use a variety of skills to move forward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dramatic truth surrounding the girls Mags, where guilt, anger, and sadness intertwine.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2870160?t=1772534418","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2870160?t=1772534418","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870160/0f94c5a0a89967f50244327ed929ab6782e664d5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772534418","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870160/0f94c5a0a89967f50244327ed929ab6782e664d5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772534418","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3305790,"description":"